{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13107190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13107190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1310719001:0":{"text":"또라니요? 전 아직 마법을 시전하지도 않았는걸요? 혹시 다른 곳에서 절 만난 적이 있으셨나요?","source_cn":"又？我还没有施过法啊？难道你们曾经在别的地方见过我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x722C813B54E4B26E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310719002:0":{"text":"이상하네요. 여러분 같은 조합을 잊어버렸을 리가 없는데.","source_cn":"奇怪，你们这样的组合，我不该一点印象都没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20B43F07466BB78B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310719003:0":{"text":"만난 적이 있었죠. 게다가 그 결과도 엉망진창이었고요...","source_cn":"我们确实见过，而且后果一团糟……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C48DC667590D358","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310719004:0":{"text":"엉망진창이라... 레즈크가 결혼하던 그때를 말씀하시는 건가요? 아니면 코페르 마을에서 쥐로 인한 피해를 처리하던 그때를 말씀하시는 건가요? 그것도 아니면... 어린 제스코바의 바비 인형이 스스로 도망친 그때를 말씀하시는 건가요?","source_cn":"一团糟……你们说的是雷兹克结婚那次，还是科佩村除鼠害那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40618DC09BBE47C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310719005:0":{"text":"...대체 몇 번을 망친 거예요!","source_cn":"……你到底搞砸过多少次啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA942BEEDF0EFF4C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:魔法师维茨瓦夫":{"text":"마법사 비츠와프","source":"魔法师维茨瓦夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}